<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 196 0 R
/T (       Despite personal care, cosmetics, and toiletries representing a major market segment in the Philippines, the specific socio-economic and demographic factors that distinguish high-spending households from low-spending households remain underexplored. Necessitating a supervised binary classification approach using Philippine Statistics Authority \(PSA\) Family Income and Expenditure Survey \(FIES\) data to accurately predict household personal care spending tiers.)
/E (       Despite personal care, cosmetics, and toiletries representing a major market segment in the Philippines, the specific socio-economic and demographic factors that distinguish high-spending households from low-spending households remain underexplored. Necessitating a supervised binary classification approach using Philippine Statistics Authority \(PSA\) Family Income and Expenditure Survey \(FIES\) data to accurately predict household personal care spending tiers.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
